flowchart LR
  UI[Desktop UI] -->|profile + PDF| API[Local API]
  API --> POLICY[Offline policy + public schemas]
  POLICY --> WORKER[Managed local worker]
  WORKER --> PDF[Layout / OCR / translate / fit]
  PACK[Verified local asset pack] --> WORKER
  CACHE[Private local cache] --> PDF
  PDF --> REPORT[Public report without engine identity]
  REPORT --> UI
  DENY[Internet egress: denied]
